  },
  "body": "As shown by\nhttp://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=4320, this\nhas only ever been implemented in one browser (IE/Edge). In the many\nyears since it was added to the spec, no other engines have made a move\nto support this feature. It is time to remove it.\n\nPrevious discussion at\nhttps://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=12735.\n\nCloses #1537.\n\n---\n\nI would prefer to get affirmative confirmation from the three non-implementing engines that they are not planning to implement this feature:\n- [x] Blink, @tkent-google?\n- [x] WebKit, @cdumez?\n- [x] Gecko, @smaug----? Also @bzbarsky since I see his name in [a nearby TODO in the Gecko code](http://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/source/dom/html/nsHTMLDocument.cpp#1395)\n",
